# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# Rider / ReSharper
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user
_ReSharper*/

# VS Code (keep workspace-shared settings if any are added later)
